5. **If smoke fully succeeds:** Stage 1 done. Continue to Stage 2 (SH01+SH02 adjacent pair) или Stage 3 (full episode anchor mode).

6. **If new bug surfaces:** debug + fix + commit + squash pattern (familiar workflow).

